The [[Walrus Tusk]] is a common [[Accessory]] available in the shop for all classes. It does very little on its own, especially for an item that takes up two spaces, giving only a single {{icon/spikes}} at start of battle, but it crafts into a number of different {{icon/spikes}}-themed items.
